<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="6791041790"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:12.533"><div begin="15.137" end="43.560" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="15.137" end="21.901" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="15.137" end="16.093">如果</span><span begin="16.093" end="16.477">说</span><span begin="16.477" end="16.861">背</span><span begin="16.861" end="17.399">叛也</span><span begin="17.399" end="17.949">是</span> <span begin="18.230" end="18.946">被爱</span><span begin="18.946" end="19.278">的</span><span begin="19.278" end="19.702">一</span><span begin="19.702" end="20.045">部</span><span begin="20.045" end="21.901">分</span></p><p begin="22.341" end="30.133" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="22.341" end="23.324">暴风</span><span begin="23.324" end="23.562">雨</span><span begin="23.562" end="23.951">来</span><span begin="23.951" end="24.485">临之</span><span begin="24.485" end="25.092">前</span> <span begin="25.284" end="25.699">表</span><span begin="25.699" end="25.910">面</span><span begin="25.910" end="27.138">干净得</span><span begin="27.138" end="30.133">很</span></p><p begin="30.439" end="37.473" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.439" end="30.820">对</span><span begin="30.820" end="32.178">爱</span><span begin="32.178" end="32.410">的</span><span begin="32.410" end="33.399">人</span> <span begin="33.804" end="34.251">我总</span><span begin="34.251" end="35.406">学不会</span><span begin="35.406" end="36.520">残</span><span begin="36.520" end="37.473">忍</span></p><p begin="37.775" end="43.560" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.775" end="38.260">一</span><span begin="38.260" end="38.524">再</span><span begin="38.524" end="39.117">的</span><span begin="39.117" end="39.436">原</span><span begin="39.436" end="40.023">谅</span><span begin="40.023" end="40.361">有</span><span begin="40.361" end="40.895">多</span><span begin="40.895" end="41.326">天</span><span begin="41.326" end="43.560">真</span></p></div><div begin="44.636" end="1:11.709" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="44.636" end="50.259" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.636" end="45.103">你</span><span begin="45.103" end="45.255">的</span><span begin="45.255" end="45.760">沉</span><span begin="45.760" end="46.193">默</span> <span begin="46.469" end="46.879">比</span><span begin="46.879" end="47.007">你</span><span begin="47.007" end="47.412">诚</span><span begin="47.412" end="47.964">实</span><span begin="47.964" end="48.316">多</span><span begin="48.316" end="50.259">了</span></p><p begin="50.565" end="58.282" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.565" end="51.526">后来</span><span begin="51.526" end="51.780">我</span><span begin="51.780" end="52.166">不</span><span begin="52.166" end="52.342">再</span><span begin="52.342" end="52.813">追</span><span begin="52.813" end="53.192">问</span> <span begin="53.525" end="53.930">不</span><span begin="53.930" end="54.074">再</span><span begin="54.074" end="55.453">期盼什</span><span begin="55.453" end="58.282">么</span></p><p begin="58.812" end="1:01.819" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.812" end="1:00.551">数不清是第几个</span><span begin="1:00.551" end="1:00.862">凌</span><span begin="1:00.862" end="1:01.819">晨</span></p><p begin="1:02.072" end="1:05.488" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.072" end="1:02.529">我用</span><span begin="1:02.529" end="1:03.570">着什么</span><span begin="1:03.570" end="1:04.669">身</span><span begin="1:04.669" end="1:05.488">份</span></p><p begin="1:05.585" end="1:11.709" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.585" end="1:06.513">等</span><span begin="1:06.513" end="1:07.374">你宣</span><span begin="1:07.374" end="1:07.597">判</span><span begin="1:07.597" end="1:09.121">我们不</span><span begin="1:09.121" end="1:09.407">可</span><span begin="1:09.407" end="1:11.709">能</span></p></div><div begin="1:11.719" end="1:40.085" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:11.719" end="1:14.492" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:11.719" end="1:12.088">为</span><span begin="1:12.088" end="1:12.705">什</span><span begin="1:12.705" end="1:12.865">么</span><span begin="1:12.865" end="1:13.318">你</span><span begin="1:13.318" end="1:13.532">的</span><span begin="1:13.532" end="1:14.008">别</span><span begin="1:14.008" end="1:14.492">恋</span></p><p begin="1:14.635" end="1:18.651" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.635" end="1:15.108">你</span><span begin="1:15.108" end="1:15.230">的</span><span begin="1:15.230" end="1:15.733">谎</span><span begin="1:15.733" end="1:16.172">言</span> <span begin="1:16.444" end="1:16.869">你</span><span begin="1:16.869" end="1:17.032">的</span><span begin="1:17.032" end="1:17.383">为</span><span begin="1:17.383" end="1:18.240">所欲</span><span begin="1:18.240" end="1:18.651">为</span></p><p begin="1:18.807" end="1:21.526" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.807" end="1:19.739">都成</span><span begin="1:19.739" end="1:19.967">了</span><span begin="1:19.967" end="1:20.415">我</span><span begin="1:20.415" end="1:20.515">的</span><span begin="1:20.515" end="1:21.063">伤</span><span begin="1:21.063" end="1:21.526">悲</span></p><p begin="1:21.727" end="1:25.990" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.727" end="1:22.146">我</span><span begin="1:22.146" end="1:22.319">的</span><span begin="1:22.319" end="1:23.268">亏欠</span> <span begin="1:23.503" end="1:23.965">我</span><span begin="1:23.965" end="1:24.095">的</span><span begin="1:24.095" end="1:24.600">执</span><span begin="1:24.600" end="1:25.203">迷不</span><span begin="1:25.203" end="1:25.990">悔</span></p><p begin="1:26.110" end="1:30.048" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:26.110" end="1:26.277">那</span><span begin="1:26.277" end="1:27.077">天大</span><span begin="1:27.077" end="1:27.671">雨</span><span begin="1:27.671" end="1:27.844">淋</span><span begin="1:27.844" end="1:28.654">湿了</span><span begin="1:28.654" end="1:29.621">我的</span><span begin="1:29.621" end="1:30.048">脸</span></p><p begin="1:30.108" end="1:33.364" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:30.108" end="1:31.635">在车窗里的你装</span><span begin="1:31.635" end="1:32.253">没看</span><span begin="1:32.253" end="1:33.364">见</span></p><p begin="1:33.374" end="1:40.085" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:33.374" end="1:34.323">最遥远</span><span begin="1:34.323" end="1:34.613">的</span><span begin="1:34.613" end="1:35.062">距</span><span begin="1:35.062" end="1:35.528">离</span> <span begin="1:35.528" end="1:35.863">是</span><span begin="1:35.863" end="1:36.908">你在</span><span begin="1:36.908" end="1:37.437">他身</span><span begin="1:37.437" end="1:40.085">边</span></p></div><div begin="1:41.550" end="1:54.903" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:41.550" end="1:42.650" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:41.550" end="1:42.650">黄昏的街灯</span></p><p begin="1:42.660" end="1:45.045" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:42.660" end="1:44.677">它把我的影子拉向远</span><span begin="1:44.677" end="1:45.045">方</span></p><p begin="1:45.055" end="1:46.424" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:45.055" end="1:46.181">没有你的城</span><span begin="1:46.181" end="1:46.424">市</span></p><p begin="1:46.434" end="1:48.534" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:46.434" end="1:48.219">走到哪里都像是流</span><span begin="1:48.219" end="1:48.534">浪</span></p><p begin="1:48.624" end="1:51.924" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:48.624" end="1:49.898">朋友都劝我放</span><span begin="1:49.898" end="1:51.924">手</span></p><p begin="1:52.081" end="1:54.903" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:52.081" end="1:53.706">要去过新的生活</span> <span begin="1:53.706" end="1:54.131">我才</span><span begin="1:54.131" end="1:54.389">不</span><span begin="1:54.389" end="1:54.903">想</span></p></div><div begin="1:54.973" end="2:08.925" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:54.973" end="1:56.661" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:54.973" end="1:55.432">就把</span><span begin="1:55.432" end="1:55.668">我</span><span begin="1:55.668" end="1:55.768">的</span><span begin="1:55.768" end="1:56.086">爱意</span><span begin="1:56.086" end="1:56.367">掩</span><span begin="1:56.367" end="1:56.661">埋</span></p><p begin="1:56.711" end="1:58.566" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:56.711" end="1:57.203">随着</span><span begin="1:57.203" end="1:57.453">大</span><span begin="1:57.453" end="1:57.558">雨</span><span begin="1:57.558" end="1:58.126">落下</span><span begin="1:58.126" end="1:58.566">来</span></p><p begin="1:58.296" end="2:01.563" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:58.296" end="2:00.506">反正你身边也已经有他</span><span begin="2:00.506" end="2:01.563">在</span></p><p begin="2:01.603" end="2:03.580" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:01.603" end="2:02.519">明明说好</span><span begin="2:02.519" end="2:02.924">不</span><span begin="2:02.924" end="2:03.172">分</span><span begin="2:03.172" end="2:03.580">开</span></p><p begin="2:03.640" end="2:08.925" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:03.640" end="2:03.935">却只</span><span begin="2:03.935" end="2:04.508">剩</span><span begin="2:04.508" end="2:04.933">我一</span><span begin="2:04.933" end="2:05.399">个</span><span begin="2:05.399" end="2:05.819">人作</span><span begin="2:05.819" end="2:08.925">怪</span></p></div><div begin="2:09.073" end="2:33.832" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="2:09.073" end="2:10.469" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:09.073" end="2:10.469">最后一通电话</span></p><p begin="2:10.479" end="2:15.936" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:10.479" end="2:10.909">终</span><span begin="2:10.909" end="2:11.154">究</span><span begin="2:11.154" end="2:11.754">还</span><span begin="2:11.754" end="2:12.050">是</span><span begin="2:12.050" end="2:12.452">没</span><span begin="2:12.452" end="2:12.808">能拨</span><span begin="2:12.808" end="2:15.936">通</span></p><p begin="2:16.124" end="2:17.861" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:16.124" end="2:17.507">答铃循环拨放</span><span begin="2:17.507" end="2:17.861">着</span></p><p begin="2:17.871" end="2:23.454" i